s, convenient laundry and a full bathroom. The primary bedroom features a walk-in closet with a window and its own 4-piece ensuite. The rear bedrooms also enjoy lovely views overlooking the backyard. Central air conditioning keeps you comfortable through the summer. Outside, the large fenced yard offers garden boxes and a patio for relaxing or entertaining. The west-facing backyard captures afternoon and evening sun, while the front enjoys morning light. A double detached garage with extra space beside it offers added parking or storage. The basement is ready for your vision. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$420,000"],["Type","Townhouse"],["Bedrooms","3"],["Bathrooms","3"],["Half bathrooms","1"],["Living area","1,446 sq ft"],["Lot size","3,250 sq ft"],["Year built","2021"],["Storeys","2"],["Neighbourhood","Greenbury"],["Town","Spruce Grove"],["Postal code","T7X0Z9"],["MLS® number","E4516664"],["Listed","November 16, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Microwave Range Hood Combo"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Cooling","Central air conditioning"],["Fireplace","Electric"],["Basement","Unfinished, Full"],["Parking","Detached Garage"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","4.10 m × 3.36 m (13'5\" × 11'0\")"],["Dining room","Main level","4.59 m × 3.62 m (15'1\" × 11'11\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","5.71 m × 3.67 m (18'9\" × 12'0\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level","3.27 m × 3.96 m (10'9\" × 13'0\")"],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level","2.74 m × 3.93 m (9'0\" × 12'11\")"],["Bedroom 3","Upper Level","2.87 m × 2.82 m (9'5\" × 9'3\")"],["Laundry room","Upper Level","1.23 m × 0.83 m (4'0\" × 2'9\")"]],"courtesy":"Monica Halvorson, Century 21 Leading","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"spruce-grove","hood_slug":"greenbury","area":""}